:"மண்டிலம்","parts":[{"text":"மண்டிலம்","lemma":"மண்டிலம்","gloss":"earth"}],"gloss":"earth"},{"surface":"பெறினும்","parts":[{"text":"பெறு","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"obtain"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"conditional suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even suffix"}],"gloss":"even if I obtain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விடல்","parts":[{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"leave"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"abandoning"},{"surface":"சூழ்","parts":[{"text":"சூழ்","lemma":"சூழ்","gloss":"think"}],"gloss":"thinking of"},{"surface":"அலனான்","parts":[{"text":"அலன்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"I (first person singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"I am not one who"},{"surface":"நின்னுடை","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"your"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessive suffix"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"நட்பு","gloss":"friendship"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"friendship"}]}],"literal":"Blue water lily smelling thick dark tresses / White water lily smelling sweet-honey-filled red-coral mouth / Deep water lotus pollen like / Fine many beauty-spots dark-skinned beauty! / You indeed, \"do not fear\" which said my word, did not fear; / I indeed, short-legged swan on heaped sand resting / sea-surrounded earth even if I obtain, / abandoning thinking I am not, your friendship.","translation":"O dark-skinned beauty, with thick dark tresses smelling of blue water lilies, a red coral-like mouth smelling of sweet honey-filled white water lilies, and fine, numerous beauty spots like the pollen of a lotus in deep water! You trusted my words when I said, 'Do not fear.' Even if I were to obtain the entire earth surrounded by the sea where short-legged swans rest on heaped sand dunes, I would never think of abandoning your love.","modern":"குவளை மலரின் நறுமணம் வீசும் அடர்ந்த கரிய கூந்தலையும், தேன் நிறைந்த ஆம்பல் மலரின் நறுமணம் வீசும் பவளம் போன்ற வாயையும், ஆழமான நீர்நிலையின் தாமரை மலரின் மகரந்தத்தைப் போன்ற நுட்பமான பல தேமல்களையும் உடைய மாநிறத்து அழகியே! 'அஞ்சாதே' என்று நான் கூறிய சொற்களை நீ அப்படியே நம்பினாய். குட்டையான கால்களைக் கொண்ட அன்னப் பறவைகள் குவிந்த மணல் மேடுகளில் தங்கும் கடல் சூழ்ந்த உலகத்தையே நான் பரிசாகப் பெற்றாலும், உன்னுடைய அன்பை விட்டுவிடுவதைப் பற்றி நான் ஒருபோதும் நினைக்க மாட்டேன்.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to the heroine during their secret courtship, reassuring her of his eternal love and commitment. He praises her exquisite beauty, comparing her hair to blue water lilies, her mouth to honeyed white water lilies, and her beauty spots to lotus pollen. He acknowledges that she trusted his promise of 'do not fear' (அஞ்சல்). He declares that even if he were offered the entire sea-girt earth as a prize, he would never dream of abandoning her friendship and love. The imagery of the short-legged swan resting peacefully on the heaped sand dunes of the seashore reflects a sense of safety, comfort, and domestic bliss, mirroring the trust the heroine has placed in the hero's words.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.8],[3.8,4.35],[4.35,5.1],[5.1,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.59],[7.59,8.1],[8.1,8.1],[8.1,9.1],[9.1,10.1],[10.1,10.49],[10.49,10.8],[10.8,11.4],[11.6,11.66],[11.69,11.74],[11.74,13.2],[13.2,13.6],[13.6,14.8],[14.8,15.0],[15.0,15.4],[15.4,16.64],[16.64,16.88],[16.88,17.0],[17.0,18.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.9],[1.9,2.4],[2.4,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,4.3],[4.3,4.9],[4.9,4.9],[4.9,6.7],[6.7,6.9],[6.9,7.2],[7.2,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,10.87],[10.87,12.2],[12.2,12.95],[13.2,13.68],[13.68,14.2],[14.2,14.8],[14.8,15.2],[15.2,16.3],[16.3,16.7],[16.7,17.1],[17.1,18.34],[18.34,18.58],[18.58,18.7],[18.7,19.8]]},"sync":[[["குவளை","blue water lily"]],[["நாறும்","smelling of"]],[["குவை","thick"],["இரும்","